        // the end of the stream). The dictionary is parsed (`out` is scratch) with its abbreviations; the data span and
        // the place after `EI` are PI_DSTART, PI_DEND and PI_DNEXT. Answers 0, or 1 when there is no `ID`, 2 when the
        // dictionary does not parse.
